Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?[Inductor]=20Prevent=20fusing=20atomic=20scatte?=
 =?UTF-8?q?r=20ops=20with=20dependent=20reads=E2=80=A6=20(#172301)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

…Scatter operations (index_add_, scatter_add_) with scatter_mode=atomic_addrequire all threads to complete writes before any reads. Fusing them withsubsequent reads caused read-after-write hazards. Added check in fusable_read_and_write() to prevent this unsafe fusion. For arbitrary large inputs barriers cant be useful and hence atomic adds should not be fused.

Fixes #171493

Pull Request resolved: https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/172301
Approved by: https://github.com/jansel, https://github.com/tianrengao
---
